Czym jest `RequestProcessor` z perspektywy zależności?
```
@AllArgsConstructor
public class RequestProcessor {
    private Dispatcher dispatcher;
    private List<Handler> handlers;
    public Response processRequest(Request request) { return dispatcher.processRequest(request, handlers); }
}
```

